I disagree- the following strategy gets me from the castle to the endgame,
with a few snacks in Hell:

Use a bag of holding. Take all the food of soldier corpses and stuff it in.
Whenever you get hungry, apply the bag, take out one ration, and munch on it.
There are usually around 100 rations from the soldiers, and you can also
get more in Gehennom. This strategy works just as well anywhere else- usually
by the time you're ready to go on the Quest you have a BoH (one of the almost
required items nowadays) and have killed several soldiers.
